            "review_title": "Review at Curry House Maiya",
            "review_text": "トシ\nNaha, Japan16 contributions\n0\nIt's delicious!\nApr 2024 • Solo\nWhen I travel, I mainly eat local cuisine, but I remembered the curry I had in Thailand and Taiwan a few years ago, where the seasoning and side dish style were different from those in Japan and it felt fresh.\nI had never eaten curry in Vietnam before, so when I saw the sign, I went in without hesitation.\nThe taste was just as good as any curry specialty restaurant in Japan. It was the same delicious curry I had in Japan.\nWhen I asked the owner of the restaurant, he told me that he was aiming to recreate the most delicious curry he had in Japan when he lived there.\nPersonally, I thought that Japanese-style curry made by a Vietnamese person was exquisite and had already reached that level.\nThank you for the meal✨\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten May 2, 2024",
